OL,3,CKaty Perry 'appalled' by use of song
OL,4,CFirework for White House military video
OL,6,FSinger Katy Perry has hit out at the
OL,7,FWhite House for using her hit Firework
OL,8,Fas the backing track for a social
OL,9,Fmedia post about military action.
OL,11,FIn a post on X, the star said she was
OL,12,F"appalled and angry" after a clip of
OL,13,Fthe song was used in a TikTok reel
OL,14,Fshowing military footage.
OL,16,FThe lyric "boom, boom, boom" can be
OL,17,Fheard over cockpit video of American
OL,18,Fstrikes.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/3
