OL,3,CKaty Perry 'appalled' by use of song
OL,4,CFirework for White House military video
OL,6,FPerry made it clear that she did not
OL,7,Fapprove the use of her song by the
OL,8,FWhite House, and nor did she condone
OL,9,Fit.
OL,11,FThe singer, who is in a relationship
OL,12,Fwith former Canadian premier Justin
OL,13,FTrudeau, is not the first musician to
OL,14,Fcomplain about their music being used
OL,15,Fby Donald Trump for political purposes.
OL,17,FRihanna, The Smiths, Pharrel Williams
OL,18,Fand Adele are among those who have
OL,19,Fexpressed their anger after their hits
OL,20,Fwere used during his campaign rallies.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/3
